						"textAnswers": {
							"answers": [
								{
									"value": "All QSo's 80m. Worked Lance VK7TA until the amp went BOOM! Had the wrong LP filter in (might not have helped). Finished QRP. Put the amp on the bench, changed FETS and gave it another shot! The sigs got fainter so switched to listening on the active LOOP. Worked a treat on 80m and worked Ian VK7TO. Listened to QSO between Mark VK2KI and VK5KFG also on 80m....Then off to bed as it is a school night 73 de VK2AOE"
								}
