						"textAnswers": {
							"answers": [
								{
									"value": "Achievement Unlocked! After 5 years of using the Xiegu G90, I have (thanks to Willie DJ9FM) finally discovered that it has a Pre-Amp. It makes the CW sound rather harsh but it does help to pull a weak signal out of the abyss of the Ionosphere. Mind you, I had to turn it off when Mike DL3YZ pointed his Yagi at me from only 1000 kms away! Special thanks to Pat VK2IOW and Manny VK3DRQ for their great work in connecting me, once again, into the collective endeavour that is the Tuesday QRS jamboree."
