						"textAnswers": {
							"answers": [
								{
									"value": "Focusing on 20m this week, Ive been experimenting with mix 61 toroid for my end fed verticle for 20-10m work.  It appears to work well as a 64:1 unun with 2:16 turns, but shortens the overall electrical length of the system.   I will build and test a 3:24 turn and maybe a 4:32 turn version for a bit more impedence on the primary and secondary turns.   Im hoping to create a more efficient unun to squeeze a bit more radiated power out of my 100 w radio!!"
								}
