						"questionId": "0e70c164",
						"textAnswers": {
							"answers": [
								{
									"value": "Well, that was an interesting night! I came up on 40m to make a few QRS contacts and ended up with DX station after DX station coming back to me! It was great to work Sava on 160m as well.\n\nBy the way, have you tried 17m? If you're about, especially during the day, try putting out a call. I've had a lot of fun on 17m lately, particularly down by the salt water with a little mag loop."
